<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Industri-Matematik started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Industri-Matematik started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Corp said it started coverage of Industri-Matematik International Corp with short- and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings estimates at $0.12 per share for 1997 and $0.33 per share for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 11.</p>
</text>
